      "options": {},
      "values": {
        "text": {
          "Text": "Two Ratio Gears count the same Master Gear: Teeth 3 : 1 turn the outer comet three times a loop and 2 : 1 turn the inner one twice, three against two. They only meet at the top, once a loop. Change either gear's Teeth, to 5 : 1 say, and it lands at once where it would be had it always run so; click Reverse to send it the other way."
        }
      },
